<%# What an answer replaces. The element around it persists and carries both the
    Stimulus controller and the `aria-live` region, so a change of state is
    announced rather than silently swapped in — a region replaced along with its
    contents announces nothing.

    `data-polling` is how the zone tells the controller whether to ask again: a
    settled zone says `false`, and the asking stops because the server said so.
    `data-outcome` says what happened to each block, which is another question —
    a refusal and a document both stop the asking. The controller replaces
    nothing while the answer says what the zone already says: the waiting is one
    waiting, and one announcement. %>
<div class="demo-request__body" data-polling="<%= polling? %>" data-outcome="<%= outcome %>">
  <% if combined? %>
    <%# One button for every type of the combination, which is the only thing
        that satisfies it (chapter 3.2.2 §2.3). The waiting and the failure to
        reach the service are those of a block, written once more here. %>
    <div class="demo-request__block" data-demo-request-block data-state="idle">
      <%= button_to t('components.demo_request_zone.submit_all'), button_path,
            class: 'fr-btn fr-btn--icon-left fr-icon-arrow-down-circle-line', lang: 'en',
            form: { class: 'demo-request__button', data: { demo_request_target: 'button' } } %>

      <%= tag.p class: 'fr-mb-0 demo-request__state demo-request__state--waiting', lang: 'en',
            hidden: true, data: { demo_request_target: 'loading' } do %>
        <span class="demo-request__spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <%= t('components.demo_request_zone.loading_all') %>
      <% end %>

      <%= tag.p class: 'fr-mb-0 demo-request__state demo-request__state--waiting', lang: 'en',
            hidden: true, data: { demo_request_target: 'disconnected' } do %>
        <span class="fr-icon-error-warning-line demo-request__failed" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <%= t('components.demo_request_zone.disconnected_html',
              reload: link_to(t('components.demo_request_zone.reload'), helpers.admin_demo_documents_path)) %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <% blocks.each do |block| %>
      <%= render block %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>
